## Scope and duplicate policy

- `lua/zapret-wgobfs.lua` is intentionally absent. Its `wgobfs` function
  is already present in official `lua/zapret-obfs.lua` for modern zapret2.
- Multiple names with identical Git blob contents are represented by a
  single canonical file. Other names are documented in `docs/ALIASES.md`.
- Extra resources are **not automatically loaded or activated**. Users
  should select strategies and module combinations consciously.
- File-level attribution can be improved as new original-source evidence
  is discovered. No single project claims ownership of every packet
  payload or every function.

